            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Напиши метод HTTP-запроса, который <em>удаляет</em> данные с сервера.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DELETE https://fakenews.com/article/112\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"PUT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"POST\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"GET\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>DELETE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Удали статью <code>112</code> с сервера <code>fakenews.com</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DELETE https://fakenews.com/article/112\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"PUT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"POST\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"GET\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"mimo.org\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>DELETE</code>, а затем <code>fakenews.com</code>.</p></body></html>",
