            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Отправь <code>DELETE</code> запрос на сервер по адресу <code>fakenews.com</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DELETE https://fakenews.com/article/485\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>DELETE</code>.</p></body></html>"
