            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Отправь ответ вместе с правильным кодом состояния.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.delete(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" userId = req.params.id;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;User deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"User deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>res</code>, затем <code>.</code>, а затем <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>204</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>После удаления используй статус успеха без содержимого и заверши ответ без тела.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"delete\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/users/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userId\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"params\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"id\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"status\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"204\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>res</code>, затем <code>.</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>204</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>.</code>, и наконец <code>send</code>.</p></body></html>",
